{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22091","headline":"新乐府 鵶九劒\t思决壅也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 鵶九劒\t思决壅也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欧冶子死千年後，精灵闇授张鵶九。\n鵶九铸劒吴山中，天与日时神借功。\n金铁腾精火飜焰，踊跃求爲镆鎁劒。\n劒成未试十余年，有客持金买一观。\n谁知闭匣长思用，三尺青蛇不肯蟠。\n客有心，劒无口，客代劒言告鵶九。\n君勿矜我玉可切，君勿夸我钟可刜。\n不如持我决浮云，无令漫漫蔽白日。\n爲君使无私之光及万物，蛰虫昭苏萌草出。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22091.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22091","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}